    "title": "Becoming more humid to close the week before heavy rain arrives this weekend - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Brad Hlozek ,\n6 hours ago DEEP EAST TEXAS (KTRE) - It will be mostly clear and on the chilly side with overnight lows in the lower 50’s. After another chilly start to Thursday, southerly winds will return in earnest, bringing back more warmth and humidity back to the Piney Woods as we close out the week with highs climbing back into the lower-to-middle 80’s. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
